    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d208-a1">

                <pb facs="0269" n="219" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg219"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Eustis.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-06-25"><hi rendition="#italic">June
                        25</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President directs me to communicate through you to the Government of France
                    and to Madame Carnot the following resolutions <pb facs="0270" n="220"
                        xml:id="pg220"/> this day adopted in the Senate and House of Representatives
                    of the United States expressing condolence with the French nation and the loss
                    it has sustained, and abhorrence of the assassination.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
